{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04978","headline":"临水亭 · 王适","name":"临水亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高馆基曾山，微幂生花草。\n傍对野村树，下临车马道。\n清朗悟心术，幽遐备瞻讨。\n回合峰隐云，联绵渚萦岛。\n气似沧洲胜，风爲青春好。\n相及盛年时，无令叹衰老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}